/// # Safety
///
/// * `pk` must be valid for reads of 32 bytes.
/// * `signature` must be valid for reads of 64 bytes.
/// * `challenge` must be valid for reads of 64 bytes.
/// * `scratch` must be valid for reads and writes of 8192 bytes.
